# KORVANE COLD CHAIN SP. Z O.O. — HACCP PLAN FOR REEFER HANDLING

**Document no.:** KC-QF-HACCP-001 · **Revision:** 10 · **Effective from:** 7 October 2024 · **Replaces:** revision 9 (effective 1 March 2024) · **Classification:** controlled document, internal (customers and certification bodies may receive a PDF copy on request)

