| CCP-1 | Gate-in product core temperature | S3 | 15 | gate clerk |
| CCP-2 | Maximum time without power | S5 | 20 | plug-in operator and Tidewalk |
| CCP-3 | Unit performance and final set point check | S4, S9 | 15 | PTI technician |
